  "term": "rehabilitation",
  "definition": "Rehabilitation is a set of interventions designed to improve abilities that have been affected and to build compensatory, adaptive ways of functioning. In the neuropsychological context, it targets cognitive, emotional, and social difficulties while strengthening preserved skills to improve everyday functioning and quality of life.",
